connection), index.html showed an empty white container. It now shows the «بصير» mark (brand assets/ef-baseer-icon.svg,
unaltered) and the name in the system font, so nothing waits for the web fonts; React replaces it when it mounts. The
mark's pulse stops for users who prefer reduced motion.

